  entireIntroUI: {fileID: 469155925}
  fullText: "[Press E to skip]\n\nYou're off to look after Brinkley, such a cute
    dog. Carol is such a good friend, you're always happy to help. Even after a long
    shift and a run in with your ex. \n\nDriving at night is normally pretty peaceful,
    but today it feels strange... "
